        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 3.09 \"Resident\" means a person who has maintained his permanent home in the above defined geographical area for a period of not less than one year or who, having had a permanent home in this area, has temporarily left with the intention of returning to this area as his permanent home.",
